<title>FINLAND: NEWS CONFERENCE ON FINNISH BUDGET AT 1600 - FINMIN.</title>
<headline>NEWS CONFERENCE ON FINNISH BUDGET AT 1600 - FINMIN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto will hold a news conference today at 1600/1300 GMT on the finance ministry's proposals for next year's state budget, the ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Niinisto, second finance minister Arja Alho, and top officials at the finance ministry have been working on the proposals since Monday and talks with other ministries are due to start on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The government is due to start its budget talks on August 13.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
